# capgemini

###
# @name valid dni
PATCH http://localhost:1080/check-dni
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "222222"
}

###
# @name invalid dni
PATCH http://localhost:1080/check-dni
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "99999999w"
}

###
# @name email
POST http://localhost:1080/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "message"
}

